# The whole screen: a full-screen terminal's lines start at its left edge. Then onto the corner as the
# dot comes on, blue and orange, with the menu bar sliding over it and away; out for the answer, and
# in again as the dot goes out. The dot is 8 points: the focus is twice as close and the one that
# goes past pixel for pixel.
@ask-1.2      0 0 2304
@ask-0.2      0 0 2304
@ask+0.6      1152 0 1152
@back+1.2     1152 0 1152
@approve-0.6  0 0 2304
@approve+0.2  0 0 2304
@approve+1.0  1152 0 1152
@done+0.8     1152 0 1152
@done+1.6     0 0 2304
